[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637707927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123390#issuecomment-5637707927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123390","id":5637707927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUAiYlw","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T16:46:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:46:12Z","body":"I can confirm that this happens in all rendering modes.\n\nHowever, I noticed another issue while reproducing the problem—this might be where the actual bug lies:\nIf you set the `Limit Mode` to `Length`, save and reload the project, and then switch the `Limit Mode` back to `Time` an error occurs during output\n`ERROR: Signal 'frame_pre_draw' is already connected to given callable 'Trail3D::_process_trail' in that object.`\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637707927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5773938052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123390#issuecomment-5773938052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123390","id":5773938052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWCdNhA","user":{"login":"ArjunCodess","id":137415649,"node_id":"U_kgDOCDDL4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137415649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess","html_url":"https://github.com/ArjunCodess","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArjunCodess/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T09:09:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T09:09:35Z","body":"hi, i'd like to work on this.\n\nwidth, color, tiling, and pin uv only set `_needs_rebuilding`. the mesh updates inside `_process_trail()`, which calls `rebuild()`. time mode runs that from `frame_pre_draw`. `set_limit_mode()` drops that connection when switching to length, and length mode only calls `_process_trail()` from `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED`. a still trail never gets that notification, so the new width or color stays invisible until the node moves. editing a curve still updates, because the curve changed signal calls `rebuild()` itself.\n\ni would call `rebuild()` from those setters while limit mode is length, and add a test that a still trail changes width after the switch. min section length stays as it is.\n\ndoes that match the update you want, or should length mode keep a frame callback that only rebuilds when `_needs_rebuilding` is set?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5773938052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5774007460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123390#issuecomment-5774007460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123390","id":5774007460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWChcpA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T09:15:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T09:15:14Z","body":"Please see our [guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine